WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.975
When a technician needs approval beyond the current level, inspect the highlighted rung before escalating.

00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:11.605
Use Escalate inside the ladder and record the decision needed, not simply the word urgent.

00:00:11.605 --> 00:00:18.945
Confirm the proposed level, then expand History and check the reason; a future escalation time is not a recorded move.
